As an AI language model, I don't have personal preferences or opinions, but generally speaking, if someone were to be the ruler of the world:

1. Create a global education curriculum that teaches critical thinking and cultural competence;

2. Establish an international body that focuses on global health and well-being, including mental health;

3. Promote sustainable development practices worldwide and provide incentives for businesses to participate;

4. Encourage cultural exchange programs and tourism between countries as a way to foster understanding and cooperation;

5. Implement policies that promote gender equality and empower women to achieve their full potential.

Note: The above are general suggestions, and implementing such measures will require careful planning, collaboration, and coordination by experts from various fields.
